## LOGIC
Word guessing algorithm.
1. Maintain a single source of truth to avoid sync issues with duplicate data sources. Implemented by using a stateless wordlist and recomputing every time a check needs to happen then updating the counter.

## DART
Dart's null-safety does not allow a reference to be used without assigning a value. For nullable references, dart already assigns null to the reference at declaration making it safe to use. String? hint; is already assigned null while Non-null String hint; must be assigned a value before running.
#### Logic
Functions:
Declare type expected on return, parameters in brackets should have type as well.
Ensure you return the type intended.
